      {
        "id": "growth_quality_summary",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Growth quality at a glance\n\nMay 2026 completed trips rose **+2.1%** year over year to **15.35M**. Average Request-to-Pickup Time increased **+8.8%** to **5.49 minutes**, while P90 increased **+16.9%** to **10.44 minutes**. The long-wait tail therefore deteriorated faster than trip volume grew.\n\nPassenger base fare and driver pay are shown as separate per-trip measures. The dashboard does not use their difference as platform revenue, profit, margin, or take rate. Completed-trip data shows observed service pressure; it does not establish unserved demand or a causal supply shortage.\n",
